{
  "key": "letter-056-part-01",
  "number": 56,
  "generationId": "01a1e4f7-a6b5-7eba-aef0-6206e95157b2",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.700204
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I have received your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9356009999999997,
      "end": 3.213991
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I was very glad indeed to get it, more so since you have sent a blank sheet.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.6559859999999995,
      "end": 8.280793999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But I have read in it all that you have not written but wanted to write.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/04.mp3",
      "start": 9.73229,
      "end": 13.018298999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Besides, what can words say?",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/05.mp3",
      "start": 14.314172000000001,
      "end": 16.446576
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Even after writing, what you had meant to write remains unwritten.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.710295,
      "end": 21.598798000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "So your silent letter is very lovely.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/07.mp3",
      "start": 23.060204,
      "end": 25.458141
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "As it is, whenever you come to see me you are mostly silent, but your eyes tell all, and your silence too.",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/08.mp3",
      "start": 26.989796,
      "end": 34.455600999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Some deep thirst has touched you, some unknown shore has called you Whenever God calls he calls this way - but how long will you go on standing on the shore?",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/09.mp3",
      "start": 35.958617000000004,
      "end": 47.341995
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Look!",
      "path": "audio/1969-56/10.mp3",
      "start": 48.914422,
      "end": 50.23
    }
  ]
}
